{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44261","headline":"感怀寄人 · 鱼玄机","name":"感怀寄人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恨寄朱弦上，含情意不任。\n早知云雨会，未起蕙兰心。\n灼灼桃兼李，无妨国士寻。\n苍苍松与桂，仍羡世人钦。\n月色苔阶净，歌声竹院深。\n门前红叶地，不埽待知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}